        "original_id": "48b06e4d-1217-5437-aeb5-097729a1042a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ben McNiece\n- Organizations: Essendon Football Club, Collingwood, Australian Football League\n- Events: Anzac Day clash, 2017 AFL season\n- Places: Melbourne Cricket Ground\n\nFacts:\n- Ben McNiece was born on 22 March 1992.\n- Ben McNiece is a professional Australian rules footballer who plays for Essendon Football Club in the Australian Football League.\n- The Anzac Day clash is an annual Australian rules football match between Collingwood and Essendon held on Anzac Day, 25 April, at the Melbourne Cricket Ground.\n- Ben McNiece made his Australian Football League debut in round five of the 2017 season in the Anzac Day clash against Collingwood at the Melbourne Cricket Ground.\n- Essendon defeated Collingwood by eighteen points in Ben McNiece's debut match.",
